  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies option identifiers used to configure an IKE session.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This .NET enumeration represents the Android <c>IkeSessionParams.IKE_OPTION_*</c> constants. Convert each option identifier to <see cref="T:System.Int32" /> and pass it separately to the builder's add or remove method, or to <see cref="M:Android.Net.IpSec.Ike.IkeSessionParams.HasIkeOption(System.Int32)" />. Do not combine these values with bitwise operations; the identifiers are not bit flags.</para>
      <para>An enabled configuration option does not by itself mean that the remote peer supports or has negotiated the related extension.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
